karr #31 delivered Response.cached_tokens populated in OpenAICompatible::chat_response (non-streaming). The streaming path (parse_stream_chunk) does not surface usage.prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens on Langertha::Stream::Chunk, so a streamed response aggregated via Role::Chat::aggregate_tool_calls / the stream iterator will not populate Response.cached_tokens even when the server reports it (SGLang return_cached_tokens_details, llama.cpp). Fix: surface cached_tokens on Stream::Chunk and aggregate it into the final Response. Low priority — streaming users of the knob lose only the read-back, not the knob itself.
